        <p class="lead" style="color:rgba(240,244,248,0.78);line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 24px">
          Official documentation for the <strong>NSM</strong> multiplayer modification client (<code>NSM.exe</code>), dedicated server (<code>nsm-server.exe</code>), and the <strong>AFX Portal</strong> ecosystem.
        </p>

