      <section id="client-guide" class="afx-docs-section">
        <h2>NSM Client Manual &amp; In-App Sign-In</h2>
        <p style="color:rgba(240,244,248,0.8);line-height:1.65">
          Download <a href="/download" data-no-spa="1" style="color:#00f8b9;font-weight:600"><code>NSM.exe</code></a> and run it to automatically install NSM into <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\NSM\NSM.app</code>, create Desktop &amp; Start Menu shortcuts, and launch the client.
        </p>
        <div id="client-auth" class="afx-callout">
          <strong>One-Click In-App Account Linking:</strong> When you click <strong>Sign In</strong> inside <code>NSM.exe</code>, your client communicates directly with <code>https://nsmultiplayer.com</code>, decrypts your RSA User-API-Key, and loads your custom AFX profile and avatar automatically.
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="server-setup" class="afx-docs-section">
        <h2>Setting Up an NSM Dedicated Server</h2>
        <p style="color:rgba(240,244,248,0.8);line-height:1.65" id="keymaster-guide">
          1. Download the ready-to-run <a href="/download-server" data-no-spa="1" style="color:#00f8b9;font-weight:600"><code>NSM-Server.zip</code></a> artifact (includes <code>nsm-server.exe</code>, standard resources, <code>server.cfg</code>, and <code>START-SERVER.bat</code>).<br>
          2. Open <a href="/keymaster" style="color:#00f8b9">AFX Portal (/keymaster)</a> and generate a Server Registration Key (<code>nsm_srv_...</code>).<br>
          3. Paste the key into your <code>server.cfg</code> and run <code>START-SERVER.bat</code> (or <code>nsm-server.exe +exec server.cfg</code>):
        </p>
        <pre id="server-cfg" class="afx-code-block"><code>endpoint_add_tcp "0.0.0.0:30120"
endpoint_add_udp "0.0.0.0:30120"

sv_hostname "^5NSM Official ^0| ^2Roleplay &amp; Freeroam"
sets sv_projectName "NSM Official Server"
sets sv_projectDesc "Custom Cars, MLOs, Active Staff &amp; Economy"
sets tags "roleplay,economy,custom-cars,nsm"
sets locale "en-US"
sv_maxclients 48

# Authenticate with the NSM Masterlist via AFX Portal Keymaster
sets sv_nsmServerKey "nsm_srv_YOUR_KEY_HERE"</code></pre>
      </section>

      <section id="scripting" class="afx-docs-section">
        <h2>Creating a Resource (<code>fxmanifest.lua</code>)</h2>
        <pre class="afx-code-block"><code>fx_version 'cerulean'
game 'gta5'

author 'Cravenz'
description 'NSM Custom Gameplay Resource'
version '1.0.0'

client_scripts { 'client/main.lua' }
server_scripts { 'server/main.lua' }</code></pre>
      </section>

      <section id="natives" class="afx-docs-section">
        <h2>Interactive Native Reference</h2>
        <div class="discourse-table-wrap">
          <table class="discourse-topic-table" id="afx-natives-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Native / Function</th>
                <th>Realm</th>
                <th>Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr data-native-row="registercommand command console chat">
                <td><code style="color:#00f8b9">RegisterCommand(commandName, handler, restricted)</code></td>
                <td><span class="nsm-loaf">Shared</span></td>
                <td>Registers a chat or F8 console command on client or server.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr data-native-row="triggerclientevent event net client">
                <td><code style="color:#00f8b9">TriggerClientEvent(eventName, playerId, ...)</code></td>
                <td><span class="nsm-loaf">Server</span></td>
                <td>Sends a network event from the server to one or all connected clients (<code>-1</code>).</td>
              </tr>
              <tr data-native-row="triggerserverevent event net server">
                <td><code style="color:#00f8b9">TriggerServerEvent(eventName, ...)</code></td>
                <td><span class="nsm-loaf">Client</span></td>
                <td>Sends a network event from the client to the NSM server.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr data-native-row="sendnuimessage nui html cef ui">
                <td><code style="color:#00f8b9">SendNUIMessage(dataTable)</code></td>
                <td><span class="nsm-loaf">Client</span></td>
                <td>Dispatches a JSON message to the resource's CEF NUI frame (received via <code>window.addEventListener('message')</code>).</td>
              </tr>
              <tr data-native-row="createvehicle vehicle car spawn">
                <td><code style="color:#00f8b9">CreateVehicle(modelHash, x, y, z, heading, isNetwork, netMissionEntity)</code></td>
                <td><span class="nsm-loaf">Shared</span></td>
                <td>Spawns a networked or local vehicle at the specified world coordinates.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr data-native-row="setentitycoords coords teleport player ped">
                <td><code style="color:#00f8b9">SetEntityCoords(entity, x, y, z, xAxis, yAxis, zAxis, clearArea)</code></td>
                <td><span class="nsm-loaf">Shared</span></td>
                <td>Sets the world coordinates of a ped, vehicle, or object entity.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
